--TEST--
a cursor on a method parameter declared `mixed` whose calls pass an `int` and a `string` is offered no type to write, only the split of its list, because no one type is already determined, `rule:ide/a-code-action-writes-only-what-is-already-determined`
--FILE--
<?nvs
final class Shop {
    public function log(mi<|>xed $value): void {
        echo $value;
    }
}

Shop $shop = new Shop();
$shop->log(3);
$shop->log('three');
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
3:24-3:38 refactor.rewrite Put on separate lines -> "(\n        mixed $value,\n    )"
